From: Jens Reidel <adrian@travitia.xyz>
Subject: [PATCH] ASoC: qcom: sm8250: Add Xiaomi Lisa soundcard compatible

Add compatible string for Xiaomi 11 Lite 5G NE (lisa).

Signed-off-by: Jens Reidel <adrian@travitia.xyz>
---
 sound/soc/qcom/sm8250.c | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/sound/soc/qcom/sm8250.c b/sound/soc/qcom/sm8250.c
index a1b2c3d..e4f5a6b 100644
--- a/sound/soc/qcom/sm8250.c
+++ b/sound/soc/qcom/sm8250.c
@@ -176,6 +176,7 @@ static const struct of_device_id snd_sm8250_dt_match[] = {
 	{ .compatible = "qcom,qrb4210-rb2-sndcard", .data = "sm4250" },
 	{ .compatible = "qcom,qrb5165-rb5-sndcard", .data = "sm8250" },
 	{ .compatible = "qcom,sm8250-sndcard", .data = "sm8250" },
+	{ .compatible = "xiaomi,lisa-sndcard", .data = "sm7325" },
 	{ .compatible = "xiaomi,taoyao-sndcard", .data = "sm7325" },
 	{}
 };
-- 
2.45.2
